      "html": "<p>I make Quickler, so read this with that in mind. Every line about another tool comes from its own website, checked on 18 November 2026. Where I could not check something, I leave it out.</p><ul><li><strong>SiteChief (formerly LifeSafety AI)</strong> (<a href=\"https://sitechief.com/pricing\" rel=\"noopener\">sitechief.com</a>). AI-powered health and safety management for UK businesses: risk assessments, incidents, permits, audits, COSHH and training records. Priced per named user: £25 a month for administrators, £5 for workers, contractors free. 30-day free trial. <em>Better when:</em> you want a whole safety system with AI throughout, not just inspections.</li><li><strong>AnyInspect</strong> (<a href=\"https://anyinspect.ai/en-GB/inspections/health-and-safety\" rel=\"noopener\">anyinspect.ai</a>). You record the walk on video and flag hazards as you go. AI categorises risks by severity and builds a report with findings tied to the moment in the video. <em>Better when:</em> video evidence of the whole walk matters to you or your client.</li><li><strong>Sitemate</strong> (<a href=\"https://sitemate.com/use-cases/safety-inspection\" rel=\"noopener\">sitemate.com</a>). A safety inspection app for construction and civil teams. You record voice observations and photos; AI drafts the report and you approve it. <em>Better when:</em> you run construction or civil sites and want inspections next to Sitemate's other site forms.</li><li><strong>Quickler</strong> (<a href=\"/pages/how-it-works.html\">how it works</a>). The person on the job answers in WhatsApp by voice note, text or photo. The AI writes out the voice notes, reads the photos, puts each answer under the right question and fills your own Word or PDF report. No app, no login. <em>Better when:</em> you already have your own report layout and the hours go on writing it up.</li></ul>"
